        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 1345/1305, Lexington Handleset with Two Dummy Cylinders</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe oval mounts of this Weslock made Lexington Dual Keyed Dummy Handleset paired with the delicate curved handle will not disappoint those looking for a classic that can withstand the ever changing fashions of today's world with undeniable elegance. It comes with your choice of inside handle style. This dummy handleset is non-locking and non-latching making the dual key holes just for show.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dual Keyed Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt as well as the lock on the exterior handle underneath the deadbolt are just for show. This handleset neither latches nor locks and is usually used on the inactive side of double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/lexington-dual-keyed-single-cylinder-handleset-weslock-1343-1300\"><b>Lexington Dual Keyed Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/lexington-dual-keyed-double-cylinder-handleset-weslock-1343-1302\"><b>Lexington Dual Keyed Double Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis classically designed handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\"><b>Weslock Traditionale Collection</b></a> which features solid brass construction and lifetime mechanical and finish warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Lexington Dual Keyed Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass.</li>\r\n<li>Removable knobs/levers prevents scratching during installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditionale Collection Lexington Dual Keyed Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Length: 19-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width:  3-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will be the same as the handleset.</i>\r\n</p>",
