                "description": "Lexington Dual Keyed Dummy Handleset - The oval mounts of this Weslock made Lexington Dual Keyed Dummy Handleset paired with the delicate curved handle will not disappoint those looking for a classic that can withstand the ever changing fashions of today's world with undeniable elegance. It comes with your choice of inside handle style. This dummy handleset is non-locking and non-latching making the dual key holes just for show.\r\n",
